.TH "Arena" "3type" "2026\-10\-07" "arena" "Arena Manuals"
.SH NAME
\fBArena\fR \- arena struct.\&
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fB#include "arena.\&h"\fR
.fi
.PP
.nf
\fBtypedef struct Arena {
  char* \fIdata\fB;
  size_t \fIcapacity\fB;
  size_t \fIoffset\fB;
} Arena;\fR
.fi
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
This is an arena struct.\&
.PP
\fIdata\fR
.RS 4
Pointer to arena data.\&
.RE
.PP
\fIcapacity\fR
.RS 4
Size of arena.\&
.RE
.PP
\fIoffset\fR
.RS 4
Offset of data.\&
.RE
.PP
.SH AUTHORS
Project and man\-page: TheCRatTime.\&
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBarena\fR(3), \fBInitArena\fR(3), \fBArenaAlloc\fR(3), \fBFreeArena\fR(3), \fBArenaReset\fR(3) 
